- kanban_workspace_source: SOURCE_PROTOCOL_COMPLETE=False (enabled:true warns, treated false, S9); strict v1 manifest
  (artifacts == []), custody, grant SourceSnapshot (absent keys = old Board vs present-null), skip memo, pickup skip,
  R4c fence (source_fenced).
- kanban_source_clones: clone proof (repo root, GitHub origin, no pushurl/url.* rewrite, ls-remote 5 s BatchMode,
  GitHub id cached 6 h per home, renames by id), attestation POST /v2/machines/me/sources from the sync round,
  404 -> board_lacks_source_route.
- kanban_source_resolver: holder path (reuse / ahead / diverged / no-manifest), materialize into the proven clone via
  refs/hermes/source/<task> (fetch --refmap=, never a tracking ref, never reset/force), return_home ff, all §6b
  WorkspaceSourceRefusal(code, scope) incl. materialize_timeout (host scope, Q3).
- kanban_source_dispatch: R4b routing on the grant snapshot before any workspace_kind branch; host refusal releases
  (infrastructure, no breaker) + memo, card refusal blocks needs_input.
- Pull-only tasks.workspace_source/workspace_custody (SERVER_COLUMNS, JSON), Lease.source_snapshot threaded through
  stage_claim, claim-gate skip memo, worker-node pickup skip, DEFAULT_CONFIG kanban.workspace_source + docs.
- Row-fields pin += source_receipt; scripts/gen_source_receipt_fixture.py carried forward (output unchanged vs spike).

